Origin of the VIBE text
-----------------------

LICENSES/LicenseRef-VIBE-1.0.txt is a copy of the file LICENSE from
https://github.com/murillo128/vibe-license at commit
ed34c78d9eb5534c1800daeb7612302f26cd84ab. The copy differs from upstream in
two ways only:

1. A copyright line was added at the top. The upstream text has no copyright
   line, but its clause 1 requires "the above copyright notice".
2. The upstream "LLM GENERATION SUMMARY" block was left out; the provenance
   record above takes its place.

All other upstream text is unchanged, including its last line,
"SPDX-License-Identifier: VIBE", which is upstream's own marker. This project's
own metadata uses LicenseRef-VIBE-1.0 instead.

